---
import LandingLayout from '@/layouts/LandingLayout.astro';
import { cars } from '@/data/cars';
import { rentalTerms, deliveryEachWaySummary } from '@/data/rental-terms';

// Every Lamborghini currently in fleet.js, with the STO first. A car that
// leaves the fleet drops out of this list on the next build. The page does
// not state a count: the owner has not confirmed the lineup is final, and the
// marketing title names STO, EVO and Urus while the Spyder is also in the data.
const usd = (n) => `$${n.toLocaleString('en-US')}`;
const bySlug = (s) => cars.find((c) => c.slug === s);
const ORDER = ['huracan-sto', 'huracan-evo', 'huracan-evo-spyder', 'lamborghini-urus'];
const lambos = [
  ...ORDER.map(bySlug).filter(Boolean),
  ...cars.filter((c) => c.make === 'Lamborghini' && !ORDER.includes(c.slug)),
];
const sto = bySlug('huracan-sto');
const evo = bySlug('huracan-evo');
const spyder = bySlug('huracan-evo-spyder');
const urus = bySlug('lamborghini-urus');
const fromPrice = Math.min(...lambos.map((c) => c.price));
const { mileage, minimumAge, deposit } = rentalTerms;

const faqs = [
  {
    q: 'Which Lamborghini should I book?',
    a: [
      sto && `The Huracán STO when the drive is the point: ${sto.power} hp, rear-wheel drive, ${usd(sto.price)} a day, age ${sto.minimumAge}, and a ${sto.deposit.display} deposit.`,
      evo && `The Huracán EVO at ${usd(evo.price)} a day when you want that V10 with a softer ride.`,
      spyder && `The EVO Spyder at ${usd(spyder.price)} a day when the roof has to come off.`,
      urus && `The Urus at ${usd(urus.price)} a day when people or luggage have to come too.`,
    ].filter(Boolean).join(' '),
  },
  {
    q: 'Can I put suitcases in a Huracán?',
    a: 'Barely. The STO, the EVO and the EVO Spyder have a small front compartment and no rear cargo area, so budget for a soft bag. Arriving from the airport with full-size luggage is a job for the Urus.',
  },
  {
    q: 'What does a Lamborghini rental include?',
    a: `Each booking includes ${mileage.includedPerDay} miles for every day, pooled across the rental rather than capped daily. The refundable deposit is ${deposit.display}${sto?.depositDiffers ? `, except ${sto.deposit.display} on the Huracán STO` : ''}. Drivers must be ${minimumAge} or over${sto && sto.minimumAge !== minimumAge ? `, except the Huracán STO, which requires ${sto.minimumAge}` : ''}, with a valid licence and insurance that covers the car.`,
  },
];

const faqSchema = {
  '@context': 'https://schema.org',
  '@type': 'FAQPage',
  mainEntity: faqs.map((f) => ({ '@type': 'Question', name: f.q, acceptedAnswer: { '@type': 'Answer', text: f.a } })),
};
---
<LandingLayout
  title="Lamborghini Rental Miami – Huracán STO, EVO & Urus | Lussaro"
  description={`Rent a Lamborghini in Miami: Huracán STO, Huracán EVO and Urus from ${usd(fromPrice)}/day. 100 miles/day, refundable deposit, delivery across Miami. Book on WhatsApp.`}
  h1="Lamborghini Rental in Miami"
  intro="Rent a Lamborghini in Miami from the cars below. They are not interchangeable, and the wrong one is the booking that wastes the day."
  only={lambos.map((c) => c.slug)}
  fleetHeading="Lamborghinis in the fleet"
  fullFleetLink
  ctaTitle="Reserve your Lamborghini"
  schema={[faqSchema]}
>
  <h2>Huracán STO, EVO, Spyder and Urus</h2>
  <p>Pick by the job. The rate on each name is the 1-day price, and a longer booking costs less per day.</p>

  {sto && (
    <>
      <h3><a href={`/cars/${sto.slug}`}>Lamborghini Huracán STO</a> — {usd(sto.price)}/day</h3>
      <p>The track car Lamborghini homologated for the street: {sto.power} hp, rear-wheel drive, {sto.zeroToSixty} to 60, a fixed rear wing and a roof scoop. Two seats, a firm ride, and room for a soft bag. Minimum age {sto.minimumAge}, with a {sto.deposit.display} refundable deposit. Photos, the full rate ladder and the booking form are on the <a href={`/cars/${sto.slug}`}>Huracán STO rental in Miami</a> page.</p>
    </>
  )}

  {evo && (
    <>
      <h3><a href={`/cars/${evo.slug}`}>Lamborghini Huracán EVO</a> — {usd(evo.price)}/day</h3>
      <p>Strictly two seats, a small front trunk, and a naturally aspirated V10 with no hybrid assistance and no quiet mode. {evo.power} hp, {evo.zeroToSixty} to 60. The front splitter sits low, so steep driveways want a slow, angled approach. It is the same engine family as the STO, with a softer ride around town.</p>
    </>
  )}

  {spyder && (
    <>
      <h3><a href={`/cars/${spyder.slug}`}>Lamborghini Huracán EVO Spyder</a> — {usd(spyder.price)}/day</h3>
      <p>The EVO with the roof off in about seventeen seconds, at speeds up to 31 mph. {spyder.power} hp, {spyder.zeroToSixty} to 60, still two seats. Take it when the open air is the point of the booking.</p>
    </>
  )}

  {urus && (
    <>
      <h3><a href={`/cars/${urus.slug}`}>Lamborghini Urus</a> — {usd(urus.price)}/day</h3>
      <p>Four doors, a boot of around 616 litres, and the ride height to clear a speed bump or a hotel ramp. A twin-turbo V8 drives all four wheels: {urus.power} hp, {urus.zeroToSixty} to 60. It is the Lamborghini that carries people and cases.</p>
    </>
  )}

  <h2>Choosing by occasion</h2>
  <ul>
    <li><strong>Airport arrival with luggage</strong> — Urus.</li>
    <li><strong>Dinner for more than two</strong> — Urus. A Huracán has two seats.</li>
    <li><strong>A photo or video shoot</strong> — the Huracán STO, for the wing and the shape.</li>
    <li><strong>A day where the driving is the point</strong> — Huracán STO.</li>
    <li><strong>The same V10, less firm</strong> — Huracán EVO, or the EVO Spyder if the roof has to come off.</li>
    <li><strong>One car across a whole week of errands</strong> — Urus.</li>
  </ul>

  <h2>Terms, briefly</h2>
  <p>To rent a Lamborghini for a day, the booking includes {mileage.includedPerDay} miles, added up across the rental rather than reset every morning. The refundable deposit is {deposit.display}{sto?.depositDiffers ? `, and ${sto.deposit.display} on the Huracán STO` : ''}, taken when the booking is confirmed and returned after the car is checked on the way back. Drivers must be {minimumAge} or over{sto && sto.minimumAge !== minimumAge ? `, or ${sto.minimumAge} for the Huracán STO` : ''}, hold a valid licence, and carry insurance covering the vehicle — or buy a daily policy from us. Lamborghini rental Miami FL delivery is {deliveryEachWaySummary}. The worked figures for a Lamborghini day rate sit in the <a href="/blog/how-much-is-a-lamborghini-rental">Lamborghini rental Miami price</a> guide, and every other number is on the <a href="/pricing">rate card</a>. For the rest of what we run, start at <a href="/exotic-car-rental-miami">exotic car rental in Miami</a>.</p>

  <h2>Questions</h2>
  {faqs.map((f) => (
    <>
      <h3>{f.q}</h3>
      <p>{f.a}</p>
    </>
  ))}
</LandingLayout>
